		<div class="topic" id="forum_op_topic_569301416225588091">
		Question for dev, about the extend of the AI art usage	</div>
	<div class="content" id="forum_op_content_569301416225588091">
		While I am not pleased entirely with the AI art usage, I do understand the circumstances.<br>As a beginner artist myself, I am slightly disappointed in that that, since there are some elements, <b>particularly CGs, which I found really good looking, beautiful even</b>.<br><br><b>Were different AI models used for the art production?</b><br><br>Because I particularly found strange that the art is very presentable and it does not at least at first glance anyway, have the usual trappings of AI image generation.<br><br>I had been enjoying the game, so I am not here to throw unnecessary hate, I just want more information in regards to this. Though it is obvious, thanks to elements being different in artstyle visually, AI was used.<br><br>I am rather critical of this, no matter the game, because visual incohesion is something I am able to notice and in some cases, it can actually hinder my enjoyment of a particular title.<br><br>I also had seen the comments and I think it is admirable that the dev is going to work on their artistic skills so they can avod this in the future. Again, as someone who is learning how to draw, I am in full support of this decision.<br><br>Thank you very much for the answer!<br><br><b>P.S. I got this game as soon as it released, thank you for such an amazing game! It is hard for me to put down!</b> <img src="https://community.akamai.steamstatic.com/economy/emoticon/steamhappy" alt=":steamhappy:" class="emoticon">	</div>
		
	<div class="forum_op_footer">
		<div class="forum_audit">
			Last edited by <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/id/newby24" class="hoverunderline">Newby24</a>;
		<span  title="October 27, 2026 @ 5:15:34 pm PST" data-timestamp="1793146534">Oct 27 @ 5:15pm</span>		</div>
			</div>
</div>
<div data-featuretarget="community-awards"></div>
<script type="text/javascript">
	$J( function() {
		InitializeForumTopic( {"owner":"46227685","type":"General","feature":"0","gidforum":"592943711836544560","forum_display_name":"General Discussions","forum_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/4958460\/discussions\/0\/","forum_search_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/4958460\/discussions\/search\/","is_public":1,"permissions":{"can_view":1,"can_post":1,"can_reply":1,"is_banned":0,"can_delete":0,"can_edit":0},"appid":4958460}, "https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/forum\/46227685\/General\/",
		"569301416225588091", {"author":"Newby24","text":"While I am not pleased entirely with the AI art usage, I do understand the circumstances.\nAs a beginner artist myself, I am slightly disappointed in that that, since there are some elements, [b]particularly CGs, which I found really good looking, beautiful even[\/b].\n\n[b]Were different AI models used for the art production?[\/b]\n\nBecause I particularly found strange that the art is very presentable and it does not at least at first glance anyway, have the usual trappings of AI image generation.\n\nI had been enjoying the game, so I am not here to throw unnecessary hate, I just want more information in regards to this. Though it is obvious, thanks to elements being different in artstyle visually, AI was used.\n\nI am rather critical of this, no matter the game, because visual incohesion is something I am able to notice and in some cases, it can actually hinder my enjoyment of a particular title.\n\nI also had seen the comments and I think it is admirable that the dev is going to work on their artistic skills so they can avod this in the future. Again, as someone who is learning how to draw, I am in full support of this decision.\n\nThank you very much for the answer!\n\n[b]P.S. I got this game as soon as it released, thank you for such an amazing game! It is hard for me to put down![\/b] \u02d0steamhappy\u02d0"}		);
			} );
</script>
										<script type="text/javascript">
$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791475749093_592943711836544560_569301416225588091", {"feature":"592943711836544560","feature2":"569301416225588091","owner":"103582791475749093","commentthreadid":"661386928","total_count":3,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":53201696,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":4958460,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"569301416225588921":{"text":"No, all the artwork was created using the same AI model. However, since the development period was quite long and I\u2019m still a beginner in this area, my art workflow changed significantly throughout development. That\u2019s why some assets have noticeable differences in art style.\n\nThank you so much for your understanding and support! I really appreciate it!","author":"EskiNott"},"569301416225589541":{"text":"[quote=EskiNott;569301416225588921]No, all the artwork was created using the same AI model. However, since the development period was quite long and I\u2019m still a beginner in this area, my art workflow changed significantly throughout development. That\u2019s why some assets have noticeable differences in art style.\n\nThank you so much for your understanding and support! I really appreciate it! [\/quote]\nNo problem. I had been anticipating this game's release ever since I discovered it and not that it finally released, I wish I could stop time, just like Sakuya, so I didn't have to worry about how much I am playing. \n\nThe concept and execution are great and it is something I greatly appreciate! Thank you very much. I got the OST too, some great tunes and I figured I could support a solo developer, who clearly has passion for the Touhou series!","author":"Newby24"},"569301416225589986":{"text":"[quote=Newby24;569301416225589541][quote=EskiNott;569301416225588921]No, all the artwork was created using the same AI model. However, since the development period was quite long and I\u2019m still a beginner in this area, my art workflow changed significantly throughout development. That\u2019s why some assets have noticeable differences in art style.\n\nThank you so much for your understanding and support! I really appreciate it! [\/quote]\nNo problem. I had been anticipating this game's release ever since I discovered it and not that it finally released, I wish I could stop time, just like Sakuya, so I didn't have to worry about how much I am playing. \n\nThe concept and execution are great and it is something I greatly appreciate! Thank you very much. I got the OST too, some great tunes and I figured I could support a solo developer, who clearly has passion for the Touhou series! [\/quote]\nThank you so much\uff01","author":"EskiNott"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
