			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_569301416225588921">
				No, all the artwork was created using the same AI model. However, since the development period was quite long and I’m still a beginner in this area, my art workflow changed significantly throughout development. That’s why some assets have noticeable differences in art style.<br><br>Thank you so much for your understanding and support! I really appreciate it!			</div>
