			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_569301416225589541">
				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b><a href="#c569301416225588921">EskiNott</a></b>:</div>No, all the artwork was created using the same AI model. However, since the development period was quite long and I’m still a beginner in this area, my art workflow changed significantly throughout development. That’s why some assets have noticeable differences in art style.<br><br>Thank you so much for your understanding and support! I really appreciate it! </blockquote>No problem. I had been anticipating this game's release ever since I discovered it and not that it finally released, I wish I could stop time, just like Sakuya, so I didn't have to worry about how much I am playing. <br><br>The concept and execution are great and it is something I greatly appreciate! Thank you very much. I got the OST too, some great tunes and I figured I could support a solo developer, who clearly has passion for the Touhou series!			</div>
			<div class="comment_footer_ctn">
